---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Sampark Karein" description="AapkaNeta.org se sampark — correction, sawal ya sujhav bhejein.">
  <style>
    .l-hero { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 44px 0; }
    .l-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .l-hero p { color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 680px; }
    .l-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .l-block h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block p, .l-block li { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
    .l-block p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 22px; }
    .l-block li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  </style>

  <div class="l-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p>Correction, sawal, sujhav ya record ka saboot — sab yahan bhejein.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@aapkaneta.org" style="color:#fbbf24">hello@aapkaneta.org</a> — correction, sawal ya sujhav seedha email par bhejein.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Correction bhejein</h2>
      <p>Har neta ki profile par <b>\"Correction bhejo\"</b> button hai. Galat tathya dikhe to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Sahi jaankari <b>saboot ke saath</b> bhejein (news link, sarkari dastavez, RTI jawab).</li>
        <li>48 ghante me jaanch hoti hai; sahi paye jaane par sudhaar turant.</li>
        <li>Bhejne wale ko jawab diya jata hai — sudhaar ho ya na ho.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Social media</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/rtibyfiroz/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram — @rtibyfiroz</a> (DM khula hai)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>RTI se record jama karein</h2>
      <p>Aapke kshetra ke kaam ka saboot aapke paas hai? <a href="/rti/" style="color:#fbbf24">RTI kaise lagayen</a> — us jawab ko hum profile par jod denge.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Kya hum jawab denge?</h2>
      <p>Haan — har gambhir sandesh ka jawab milta hai. Spam ya bina saboot ke aaropon par kaarravaai nahi hoti.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
